OL,3,GNEWSAArson spree fear in village with
OL,4,A'influx' of fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FA village has seen eight fires in the
OL,7,Fspace of two weeks, with concerns
OL,8,Fraised that they are being started
OL,9,Fdeliberately.
OL,11,FDurham Police described the blazes
OL,12,Faround Pelton, near Chester-le-Street,
OL,13,Fas an "influx", with many erupting in
OL,14,Fwooded areas, on the boundaries of
OL,15,Ffields and near a section of the C2C
OL,16,Fcycle route.
OL,18,FIt said it had received reports of
OL,19,Fgroups of young people being nearby at
OL,20,Fthe time, but officers have made no
OL,21,Farrests.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,399,390,260,160,0,100
