OL,3,GNEWSAArson spree fear in village with
OL,4,A'influx' of fires
OL,5,
OL,6,FCounty Durham and Darlington Fire and
OL,7,FRescue Service said: "What may seem
OL,8,Flike a small fire can spread rapidly,
OL,9,Fparticularly in dry vegetation, putting
OL,10,Fnearby homes, businesses, wildlife and
OL,11,Fmembers of the public at risk, as well
OL,12,Fas the firefighters."
